ractive Maps Popular pages Most visited articles Military ranks of the Philippines List of currently active United States military land vehicles Project maintenance Double redirects Broken redirects Wanted categories Wanted pages Wanted templates Uncategorized Categories Short pages Unused categories Sign In Do n't have an account ? Register Sign In Explore Fan Central Current Skip to content Military 353,117 pages Explore Main Page Discuss All Pages Community Interactive Maps\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"There is no widely known public figure named 'Judge Howe' with a commonly documented birth date. More context is needed to provide an accurate answer.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Judge Howe\", \"scope\": \"birth date\", \"claim\": \"Judge Howe was born on February 19, 1873.\", \"answer\": \"February 19, 1873\", \"quote\": \"Harland Bradley Howe Harland Bradley Howe (February 19, 1873 – April 22, 1946) was a United States federal judge. Howe was born in St. Johnsbury, Vermont on February 19, 1873, the son of Worcester C.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Judge Howe\", \"scope\": \"birth date\", \"claim\": \"Judge Howe was born on July 15, 1875.\", \"answer\": \"July 15, 1875\", \"quote\": \"Harland Bradley Howe (July 15, 1875 – April 22, 1946) was a United States federal judge. Howe was born in St. Johnsbury, Vermont on July 15, 1875, the son of Worcester C.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0137-10a83e10786d:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Judge Howe\", \"scope\": \"birth date\", \"claim\": \"Judge Howe was born on December 5, 1827.\", \"answer\": \"December 5, 1827\", \"quote\": \"James Henry Howe James Henry Howe (December 5, 1827 – January 4, 1893) was